<title>CHINA: Shanghai opens China's first automatic bank.</title>
<headline>Shanghai opens China's first automatic bank.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's first 24-hour automatic bank has opened in a hotel in Shanghai, the Business News said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bank, run by the Bank of China, will allow customers to deposit, withdraw and transfer funds, check account balances and make use of safe deposit boxes 24 hours a day without any bank staff being present, the newspaper said.</p>
